{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833830/extras/179674f0078fb62a56e30721e1efc6d6.poster.avif?t=1754960568\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833830/extras/179674f0078fb62a56e30721e1efc6d6.webm?t=1754960568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833830/extras/179674f0078fb62a56e30721e1efc6d6.mp4?t=1754960568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Survive Across the Rifts!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast out from their own worlds, warriors embark on a journey across dimensions to reclaim what they have lost.<br>On the paths that connect each world, survive relentless waves of enemies.<br>Every Rift offers unique environments and challenges \u2014 your journey is both survival and war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833830/extras/a6f4075246711125170cde4cabf3799c.poster.avif?t=1754960568\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833830/extras/a6f4075246711125170cde4cabf3799c.webm?t=1754960568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833830/extras/a6f4075246711125170cde4cabf3799c.mp4?t=1754960568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Select. Place. Grow Stronger!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rift Survivors combines the fast-paced action of Survivor-like shooters<br>with the strategic depth of an inventory-based roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the gear you acquire directly into your inventory to power up your character.<br>What you choose and where you place it creates entirely new strategies.<br>When you maximize efficiency within limited space, you\u2019ll feel the thrill of turning the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833830/extras/cab21ff80ff4cb4730ba90189c7af927.poster.avif?t=1754960568\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833830/extras/cab21ff80ff4cb4730ba90189c7af927.webm?t=1754960568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833830/extras/cab21ff80ff4cb4730ba90189c7af927.mp4?t=1754960568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Conquer the Unknown!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat swarms of enemies and take down powerful bosses.<br>Step through the portal to the next dimension.<br>Beyond the Rifts, greater challenges and rewards await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3833830?t=1754960568","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833830/64f7dd4fb693aa23c48bdd870620e24b0678f491/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754960568","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833830/af4296b29c08764a0f23c5410c8490accf34a362/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754960568","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833830/af4296b29c08764a0f23c5410c8490accf34a362/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754960568","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"